WEBVTT

01:32.480 --> 01:35.560
On the victim's body, aside from
two small wounds on the back of the hand,

01:35.640 --> 01:36.800
there were no other injuries.

01:37.800 --> 01:40.840
Judging by the evidence,
it might have been a venomous snake bite.

01:41.760 --> 01:43.000
We had just been to the Niu family,

01:43.760 --> 01:45.360
and upon returning,
Mrs. Hua was found dead in this cell.

01:46.200 --> 01:47.600
This case is far from simple.

01:48.880 --> 01:50.920
But I fear that
no matter how much we investigate,

01:51.480 --> 01:53.880
we'll only end up with a scapegoat.

02:04.520 --> 02:07.640
Tell me,
since she was just a discarded pawn,

02:08.199 --> 02:09.560
why didn't they kill her right away?

02:10.320 --> 02:11.560
You mean,

02:12.520 --> 02:14.840
Hua Xiangrong had something they wanted?

02:15.520 --> 02:18.880
And Mrs. Hua was certain
Niu Wuniang would come to rescue her?

02:22.560 --> 02:25.040
Then, why did they kill her now?

02:26.640 --> 02:30.400
We tracked the Niu family,
and she feared we might use this clue

02:30.480 --> 02:33.440
to extract more information from Mrs. Hua.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.360
So,

02:34.920 --> 02:35.880
they decided to gamble

02:35.960 --> 02:37.480
that they could find Hua Xiangrong
before us!

02:41.240 --> 02:42.840
Spread the news of Mrs. Hua's death.

02:42.920 --> 02:44.160
What are you planning to do?

02:45.800 --> 02:49.000
I'll take a gamble too,
to see if there's still…

02:50.520 --> 02:51.960
true sentiment in this world.

03:01.840 --> 03:03.520
Yingying, don't be afraid.

03:04.320 --> 03:07.160
We're back now.
This is the Brocade Bureau.

03:07.680 --> 03:09.000
She wouldn't dare come here to take you.

03:10.040 --> 03:11.640
I didn't expect this to happen.

03:14.480 --> 03:16.160
I didn't want that maid to die.

03:18.040 --> 03:19.760
I never thought she'd commit murder.

03:21.600 --> 03:22.880
This isn't your fault.

03:24.440 --> 03:25.800
Niu Wuniang

03:25.880 --> 03:27.640
is ruthless and takes human lives.

03:28.400 --> 03:31.400
The maid's death
has nothing to do with you.

03:34.560 --> 03:35.520
Yu,

03:37.720 --> 03:38.880
I used to think

03:39.400 --> 03:42.480
that all I had to deal with
was some competition between merchants.

03:44.680 --> 03:46.440
That at most,
it was about business success or failure,

03:46.520 --> 03:47.920
profit or loss.

03:50.120 --> 03:53.520
I never imagined that one day,
I'd face an enemy like this.

03:54.480 --> 03:56.680
To them, life is worthless.

03:57.880 --> 04:01.400
Killing someone
is as effortless as stepping on an ant.

04:04.280 --> 04:05.760
Just like with my father…

04:14.160 --> 04:18.079
Wait, you haven't told my brother
and mother about this, right?

04:18.160 --> 04:19.079
No, I haven't. Don't worry.

04:21.880 --> 04:24.000
If they knew,
it would only cause more worry.

04:25.280 --> 04:27.040
What are you planning to do next?

04:28.880 --> 04:31.000
That's Niu Jin,
the daughter of Vice Commander Niu.

04:31.720 --> 04:32.600
Yes,

04:33.760 --> 04:35.040
the daughter of Vice Commander Niu.

04:36.200 --> 04:37.360
So what?

04:38.840 --> 04:41.040
She won't let me go
just because I back down,

04:42.480 --> 04:45.520
and I won't stop just because
of who her father is.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.640
Yu,

04:48.680 --> 04:49.920
I can't retreat.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.720
There's no way back for me.

04:53.120 --> 04:54.520
No matter the challenges,

04:55.560 --> 04:56.840
I must forge ahead.

05:09.400 --> 05:12.720
Mr. Yang, since you saved me,
I won't go back on my word.

05:13.840 --> 05:15.280
Ask what you want to ask.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.040
You two talk.

05:29.800 --> 05:31.840
No rush. Maybe another day.

05:31.920 --> 05:34.240
I'll probably be quite busy
in the coming days.

05:35.440 --> 05:37.600
If you don't ask today, I might forget.

05:41.120 --> 05:41.960
Have a seat first.

06:05.000 --> 06:07.480
About your father,
I've heard the general story.

06:07.560 --> 06:09.200
Upon closer inspection,

06:09.280 --> 06:11.000
there are many suspicious points
in the case.

06:11.640 --> 06:14.160
As the Brocade Master,
he had plenty of ways to profit.

06:14.680 --> 06:16.600
Why commit such an obvious crime
against the emperor?

06:17.320 --> 06:19.600
These things…
have you ever thought about them?

06:19.680 --> 06:21.440
But even if I have, so what?

06:23.520 --> 06:26.280
My family has fallen into ruin,
and my mother is gravely ill.

06:28.120 --> 06:29.520
Just making a living

06:30.880 --> 06:32.320
already takes everything I have.

06:33.320 --> 06:35.960
Even if I know my father's death
has deeper truths behind it,

06:37.480 --> 06:38.600
what can I possibly do?

06:43.960 --> 06:46.280
I can't dye Shu Red Silk now,

06:47.040 --> 06:48.520
but one day, I will.

06:49.560 --> 06:50.480
When that day comes,

06:51.600 --> 06:53.240
I'll repay the life you saved.

06:54.800 --> 06:57.720
Well, I look forward to it.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.640
Mr. Yang,

07:04.520 --> 07:07.000
my family business can't do without me.
I need to return as soon as possible.

07:07.680 --> 07:10.760
Please help me arrange a place
to freshen up.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.200
Sure.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.040
I'll have someone prepare it for you.

07:16.880 --> 07:17.720
Thank you.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.880
- The carriage is ready?
- Everything's prepared.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.360
Escort Miss Ji.

07:32.120 --> 07:33.640
Take the side road
out of the Brocade Bureau,

07:34.160 --> 07:36.120
and stop a short distance
from the Ji family's gate.

07:36.640 --> 07:37.760
Understood.

07:49.920 --> 07:50.840
Thank you.

08:19.240 --> 08:21.640
All right, stop staring. She's spoken for.

08:25.080 --> 08:26.280
A flower,

08:27.080 --> 08:28.600
even if it belongs to another family,

08:29.120 --> 08:30.360
shouldn't be left to wither.

08:31.240 --> 08:33.120
He's just a discarded son
of the Yang family,

08:33.200 --> 08:34.720
a low-ranking official.

08:34.799 --> 08:36.640
Today he made you bleed,

08:36.720 --> 08:39.320
but one day, I'll make him pay in blood.

08:39.400 --> 08:42.240
For now, there was no better solution.

08:42.760 --> 08:45.960
In front of him,
if you hadn't put on a good show,

08:46.600 --> 08:49.560
this matter
would've been difficult to resolve.

08:52.080 --> 08:53.240
It's just…

08:54.760 --> 08:57.000
Just what? Speak your mind.

08:57.080 --> 09:01.080
You killed Mrs. Hua so hastily.
Wasn't it a bit rash?

09:02.120 --> 09:03.360
I'm worried

09:04.840 --> 09:05.920
that Hua Xiangrong might…

09:08.800 --> 09:09.920
What does "husband and wife" mean?

09:11.120 --> 09:13.040
You've seen it with me.

09:14.480 --> 09:18.040
"Living and dying together"
only exists in storybooks.

09:18.120 --> 09:20.960
Hua Xiangrong
has always been timid and weak.

09:21.040 --> 09:24.080
Without Hua Rong to support him,
he's nothing.

09:25.680 --> 09:26.720
While Hua Rong was alive,

09:26.800 --> 09:30.280
he might have had a chance to rise again.

09:31.880 --> 09:35.440
Now that Hua Rong is dead,
he's likely already fled for his life.

09:38.680 --> 09:40.480
Even if he dares to return,

09:40.560 --> 09:42.560
I can ensure he never leaves again.

09:42.640 --> 09:43.560
REGISTRATION DOCUMENT FOR FLUSHED ROSE

09:44.280 --> 09:47.000
Madam,
you're still focused on Ji Yingying?

09:47.840 --> 09:49.520
Unless she's driven into a corner,

09:50.440 --> 09:52.200
how will she understand

09:56.440 --> 09:58.320
who her true master is?

09:58.840 --> 10:01.120
FLUSHED ROSE

10:04.040 --> 10:05.080
All right, stop!

10:09.360 --> 10:10.640
Miss Ji, we're here.

10:10.720 --> 10:13.920
I heard that
Flushed Rose wasn't registered.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.800
I've already signed this order
and even paid the deposit.

10:16.880 --> 10:18.600
Your Ji family is ruining us!

10:18.680 --> 10:21.160
- Exactly!
- Refund the money!

10:21.240 --> 10:23.040
- We can't wait.
- Everyone, please wait a moment.

10:23.120 --> 10:26.000
Yingying has gone
to get the registration document.

10:26.520 --> 10:27.600
I sincerely apologize for the delay.

10:27.680 --> 10:29.000
Why wait any longer?

10:29.080 --> 10:30.440
Let's just barge in

10:30.520 --> 10:31.880
- and drag them to see the magistrate!
- Let's go!

10:31.960 --> 10:33.160
To the magistrate!

10:33.240 --> 10:35.280
- Why would you need to see the magistrate?
- Stop!

10:35.360 --> 10:36.440
To the magistrate!

10:36.520 --> 10:37.720
- To the magistrate!
- Yingying!

10:38.680 --> 10:41.000
Yingying is back.
Let's hear what she has to say.

10:42.920 --> 10:44.920
Everyone, let's discuss this calmly.

10:46.480 --> 10:47.880
Did you get the document?

10:49.760 --> 10:52.200
Gui, help my mother inside to rest.

10:52.920 --> 10:54.840
Mother, don't worry. I'll handle this.

10:58.720 --> 11:01.640
Ji Yingying,
in front of all these shopkeepers,

11:01.720 --> 11:03.320
be honest with us:

11:03.400 --> 11:06.320
Did Flushed Rose fail to get registered?

11:06.400 --> 11:08.760
Is our deposit completely lost?

11:08.840 --> 11:09.920
- Yes, exactly!
- Yeah.

11:10.520 --> 11:11.440
Everyone,

11:12.080 --> 11:15.600
the registration document for Flushed Rose
hasn't been issued yet.

11:15.680 --> 11:17.560
But we're working hard to resolve this.

11:17.640 --> 11:19.080
Please be patient.

11:19.160 --> 11:21.280
How do we know
this isn't just a stalling tactic?

11:21.360 --> 11:23.680
If you can't dye the silk
and fail to deliver,

11:23.760 --> 11:25.920
we'll have to compensate our buyers!

11:26.000 --> 11:27.160
- Exactly!
- Yes.

11:27.240 --> 11:28.680
- All of you, the deadline hasn't passed.
- Exactly!

11:28.760 --> 11:30.120
When it does, I, Ji Yingying,

11:30.200 --> 11:32.240
- will make sure you get your goods.
- Forget the deadline!

11:32.320 --> 11:34.000
If you can't deliver the goods,
we won't wait any longer.

11:34.080 --> 11:35.280
Let's go to the magistrate!

11:35.360 --> 11:36.720
- Yes, to the magistrate!
- Stop!

11:36.800 --> 11:37.840
To the magistrate!

11:39.240 --> 11:41.440
‪HE SHENG RICE SHOP

11:41.520 --> 11:44.440
‪HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

11:47.720 --> 11:49.880
Flushed Rose hasn't been registered,

11:49.960 --> 11:52.000
yet Huanhua Dyehouse took numerous orders

11:52.080 --> 11:53.840
and received hefty deposits.

11:54.440 --> 11:56.720
To protect your interests,

11:57.280 --> 11:59.440
Mr. Yang has requested Magistrate Meng

11:59.520 --> 12:01.880
to dispatch constables
to assist in handling the case

12:02.400 --> 12:04.760
and to detain everyone
from the Ji family on the spot,

12:04.840 --> 12:08.320
no one is allowed to enter or leave,
to appease public concern.

12:09.680 --> 12:11.880
Miss Ji, do you have any objections?

12:12.600 --> 12:13.920
The delivery date hasn't passed,

12:14.000 --> 12:17.080
so the Ji family hasn't broken any laws
or violated any agreements.

12:17.800 --> 12:18.880
However,

12:18.960 --> 12:21.680
you can't stop us from purchasing
or washing silk threads, can you?

12:21.760 --> 12:25.840
Mr. Yang said
whatever you need, just provide the money,

12:25.920 --> 12:27.440
and he'll send someone
to purchase it for you.

12:28.000 --> 12:29.680
If you need to wash silk by the creek,

12:29.760 --> 12:32.240
he'll also arrange for someone
to deliver it to the washing maids.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.720
Please thank Mr. Yang on my behalf.

12:36.840 --> 12:39.080
All right. Everyone, disperse.

12:39.720 --> 12:42.000
Mr. Yang won't let her escape.

12:42.080 --> 12:44.040
I'm not leaving! I don't believe it!

12:44.560 --> 12:46.360
I'll stay here and watch. Who's with me?

12:46.440 --> 12:47.960
- We're all staying!
- I'm staying with you!

12:48.040 --> 12:49.560
- We're all staying!
- We're staying.

12:49.640 --> 12:52.360
Fine. Mr. Yang also said

12:53.120 --> 12:55.560
that anyone causing trouble
during this time

12:55.640 --> 12:56.960
will face serious consequences.

13:05.560 --> 13:06.800
Come, take a look!

13:06.880 --> 13:09.600
Check this out!
I've got safflower for sale!

13:09.680 --> 13:10.560
QIAN'S DYEHOUSE

13:10.640 --> 13:11.880
Highest bidder wins!

13:12.960 --> 13:15.160
- I'll pay double the market price!
- I'll pay triple!

13:15.960 --> 13:17.360
- Four times!
- Five times!

13:18.280 --> 13:20.960
No, stop… We can't afford that.

13:22.520 --> 13:23.480
I'll pay ten times!

13:24.680 --> 13:25.960
That's too much.

13:27.720 --> 13:30.440
The Ji family
still hasn't delivered the goods…

13:30.520 --> 13:31.520
Tell me,

13:31.600 --> 13:33.600
how exactly did you offend Mr. Yang

13:33.680 --> 13:35.080
to make him come after our family
like this?

13:36.040 --> 13:37.840
Mr. Yang is protecting us.

13:37.920 --> 13:39.120
Protecting us?

13:40.080 --> 13:43.160
He's using this as an excuse
to station guards around our house.

13:43.240 --> 13:44.080
If not for that,

13:44.160 --> 13:46.200
those people would've already stormed in
and torn our home apart.

13:47.840 --> 13:50.240
By the way,
is there any progress on the registration?

13:50.920 --> 13:52.160
Almost there, Mother. Don't worry.

13:53.360 --> 13:54.920
All you ever say is, "Don't worry."

13:55.000 --> 13:57.280
With all these people crowding
at our doorstep, how can I not worry?

14:00.880 --> 14:01.960
Ting…

14:02.480 --> 14:04.440
Yaoting? You…

14:05.440 --> 14:07.800
I saw that soldiers
were surrounding the house,

14:07.880 --> 14:10.840
- and I couldn't climb over the walls, so…
- Yaoting,

14:10.920 --> 14:13.000
family members can come in
through the door.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.560
Yingying, are you all right?

14:19.160 --> 14:22.440
Well, I'm fine.
I'll go with you to dye the silk later.

14:23.560 --> 14:24.840
We can't dye anything now.

14:29.040 --> 14:31.520
Madam,
our people are keeping a close watch.

14:32.240 --> 14:35.400
I guarantee
there's no safflower left in the market.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.760
But how come I heard

14:41.840 --> 14:44.720
that they had already dyed a fair amount
of Flushed Rose silk earlier?

14:44.800 --> 14:47.320
That batch isn't enough
to fulfill the orders,

14:47.400 --> 14:49.120
and they wouldn't dare deliver it anyway.

14:49.840 --> 14:53.280
The people Mr. Yang sent to reapply
for registration

14:53.360 --> 14:54.320
won't make it back in time.

14:55.160 --> 14:57.840
With no registration and no dye,

14:57.920 --> 14:58.880
the double blow

14:58.960 --> 15:02.080
will ensure
the Ji family's total downfall.

15:03.720 --> 15:08.200
By then, Miss Ji will have no choice
but to turn back.

15:11.720 --> 15:12.600
What about the mountain?

15:13.920 --> 15:16.680
The mountain…
We can't make a move there for now.

15:26.520 --> 15:28.880
- It's gone.
- Yeah, where did it go?

15:28.960 --> 15:30.320
It was fine before.

15:30.400 --> 15:33.720
Exactly. How could the divine child statue
from Leizu's shrine just vanish?

15:34.240 --> 15:35.960
Didn't you hear what Mr. Yang said?

15:36.040 --> 15:37.400
The divine child statue
was manifesting last night

15:37.480 --> 15:38.440
to bless us on behalf of Leizu.

15:40.320 --> 15:44.400
Villagers, this statue is a sacred relic.

15:46.080 --> 15:47.560
Search carefully.

15:48.080 --> 15:51.000
I believe whoever finds it

15:51.080 --> 15:53.160
will surely be blessed by Leizu.

15:53.240 --> 15:54.400
Also,

15:55.240 --> 15:56.600
the Brocade Bureau promises

15:57.440 --> 16:00.640
that anyone who finds the statue
will be rewarded!

16:01.160 --> 16:02.480
- Got it!
- Got it!

16:05.600 --> 16:06.520
Mr. Yang,

16:09.000 --> 16:10.080
Chief Sang has left.

16:11.400 --> 16:13.000
Will this plan be exposed?

16:14.360 --> 16:15.640
It's better with him here.

16:15.720 --> 16:18.120
The busier the mountain gets,
the more it works to our advantage.

16:18.640 --> 16:20.480
Though we don't know
what Niu Wuniang is plotting

16:20.560 --> 16:21.880
up here in the mountains,

16:25.200 --> 16:26.520
as long as there are people around,

16:27.160 --> 16:28.320
she won't dare act recklessly.

16:29.040 --> 16:32.720
Meanwhile, we'll have more time
to slowly track down her hideout.

16:34.360 --> 16:36.040
Although I'm not a native of Yizhou,

16:36.560 --> 16:39.920
even I know how deeply
the people here revere Leizu.

16:41.440 --> 16:44.360
Using her in your schemes,
aren't you afraid of divine wrath?

16:45.640 --> 16:48.120
If Leizu truly has divine power,

16:49.240 --> 16:50.960
she should understand my intentions

16:51.600 --> 16:52.440
and would protect me even more.

16:53.920 --> 16:56.240
But if she's merely a clay statue,

16:56.320 --> 16:57.800
then the matters of this mountain

16:57.880 --> 17:00.400
shall be safeguarded
by a mortal like me for now.

17:04.520 --> 17:05.560
What are you doing?

17:08.920 --> 17:12.240
I used to think you acted arbitrarily,
brave, but without strategy.

17:12.760 --> 17:13.960
Now, I see

17:14.760 --> 17:16.160
that I misunderstood you, Mr. Yang.

17:18.000 --> 17:19.560
If you want to compliment me,
do it directly.

17:19.640 --> 17:21.079
No need to beat around the bush.

17:25.280 --> 17:26.520
Check over there!

17:36.160 --> 17:39.480
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

17:44.920 --> 17:46.240
If I accept this…

17:46.320 --> 17:47.200
MARRIAGE CONTRACT

17:49.120 --> 17:50.480
…will you let Yingying go?

17:51.240 --> 17:53.600
That depends on

17:53.680 --> 17:57.120
whether you choose
to treat me sincerely in the future.

17:59.160 --> 18:01.760
Yingying, blame my incompetence.

18:02.400 --> 18:04.360
This is the only way I can protect you.

18:05.600 --> 18:06.760
I don't regret it.

18:07.760 --> 18:08.720
But I…

18:10.200 --> 18:12.120
I don't know how to face you.

18:25.360 --> 18:26.480
What are you doing here?

18:28.680 --> 18:30.600
I know this family.

18:31.120 --> 18:32.280
Sir, could you

18:33.000 --> 18:35.840
make an exception
and let me in for a chat?

18:36.560 --> 18:37.560
Move along.

18:37.640 --> 18:40.240
We've been instructed
not to let unrelated people in.

18:41.160 --> 18:42.600
I'm not unrelated.

18:43.160 --> 18:44.200
I'm…

18:47.880 --> 18:49.040
I'm an old friend of hers.

18:51.160 --> 18:53.920
Here, could you make an exception?

18:54.000 --> 18:56.160
Don't get me in trouble. Move along!

19:00.240 --> 19:01.320
Move along!

19:03.560 --> 19:04.400
Move along now!

19:13.480 --> 19:16.040
The dog ran off with my shoe!

19:21.120 --> 19:23.400
Miss Ji, need a hand?

19:31.320 --> 19:33.040
I've got nothing left to offer you.

19:34.080 --> 19:36.920
I'm in a good mood today. No charge.

19:42.520 --> 19:43.560
Mr. Yang,

19:44.080 --> 19:47.880
for not reporting me this time,
I'm already beyond grateful.

19:49.960 --> 19:51.000
Where are you headed?

19:52.040 --> 19:52.920
To find Mr. Chen.

19:54.280 --> 19:55.120
Let's go, then.

20:15.240 --> 20:16.320
Why aren't we moving?

20:22.200 --> 20:24.160
Xiuyuan, why are you here?

20:25.480 --> 20:26.440
I…

20:29.160 --> 20:32.080
I'm in a hurry.
Mr. Yang only did this to help me.

20:32.680 --> 20:34.080
Why are you looking for me?

20:37.000 --> 20:38.080
No reason.

20:39.480 --> 20:40.600
I'm just glad you're safe.

20:44.840 --> 20:47.040
If you're busy, then go take care of it.

20:50.200 --> 20:52.320
It's about to rain.
Xiuyuan, you should head back quickly.

21:43.800 --> 21:45.680
Sir!

21:46.720 --> 21:47.720
Finally, I've found you.

21:47.800 --> 21:49.720
The carriage is just ahead.
Come back with me.

21:50.760 --> 21:51.800
Stop following me.

21:52.800 --> 21:54.680
- Sir, what is this about?
- Stop following me!

22:27.720 --> 22:34.600
YINGXI DYEHOUSE

22:35.600 --> 22:38.240
- Everything is arranged.
- All right, I'll take you home.

22:38.960 --> 22:41.120
Can you take me somewhere else first?

22:41.720 --> 22:42.600
Thank you.

22:43.520 --> 22:46.680
It's raining so heavily.
I wouldn't recommend going anywhere else.

22:47.880 --> 22:49.640
I want to see Xiuyuan.

22:51.640 --> 22:53.800
I noticed
he didn't look quite right earlier.

22:53.880 --> 22:55.240
He probably had something urgent
to tell me.

22:58.600 --> 23:01.080
- Are you sure?
- I'm sure.

23:03.200 --> 23:04.040
Fine.

23:04.800 --> 23:05.960
Consider this my good deed of the day.

23:09.280 --> 23:12.560
If you two end up together,

23:12.640 --> 23:15.160
don't forget how I braved the rain

23:15.240 --> 23:16.800
to help you meet your lover today.

23:18.880 --> 23:19.720
Let's go.

23:23.600 --> 23:27.600
ZHAO RESIDENCE

23:32.440 --> 23:33.480
Who is it?

23:34.640 --> 23:37.640
It's Ji Yingying.
Has Mr. Zhao Xiuyuan returned?

23:40.000 --> 23:42.360
Miss Ji, he hasn't come back yet.

23:48.240 --> 23:49.160
Then…

23:51.280 --> 23:53.680
When he does, please let him know

23:53.760 --> 23:56.480
that I'm fine,
and he doesn't need to worry.

23:57.080 --> 23:57.920
All right.

24:23.080 --> 24:26.080
Should we head back or wait a bit longer?

24:32.480 --> 24:33.320
Let's go back.

24:53.920 --> 24:54.760
Come on.

24:58.720 --> 24:59.560
Thank you.

25:04.760 --> 25:05.680
Hold on tight.

25:28.120 --> 25:31.360
Mother, Yaoting, everything's settled.
Don't worry.

25:31.960 --> 25:33.320
What do you mean, "Don't worry?"

25:33.840 --> 25:35.840
Ting, go make some ginger soup right away.

25:35.920 --> 25:37.120
Got it.

25:41.080 --> 25:42.440
Look at you!

25:42.960 --> 25:45.040
I told you not to go out,
but you insisted.

25:45.120 --> 25:47.200
Now your forehead's so hot.

25:52.080 --> 25:54.520
Drink the ginger soup, and rest properly.

26:01.520 --> 26:04.880
Xiuyuan, Lady Niu has come to see you.

26:07.240 --> 26:10.920
I heard you were unwell
and refusing to see a doctor.

26:11.440 --> 26:13.080
Is something troubling you?

26:13.800 --> 26:16.640
Xiuyuan, don't be rude.

26:16.720 --> 26:17.920
It's fine.

26:18.920 --> 26:20.160
When one is ill,

26:20.240 --> 26:22.760
it's natural to feel irritable
and not want to see visitors.

26:24.880 --> 26:27.840
But if he's unwell,
what about the wedding?

26:28.640 --> 26:32.600
His illness isn't severe.
He should recover soon.

26:33.480 --> 26:36.160
The wedding is set
for the end of the month.

26:36.960 --> 26:39.800
What do you think, Lady Niu?

26:41.640 --> 26:43.320
Whatever you decide.

26:43.920 --> 26:46.760
Then, I won't disturb you further.

26:51.240 --> 26:54.480
Xiuyuan, did you hear that?

26:55.520 --> 26:59.080
Don't disappoint
your grandfather's expectations.

27:01.920 --> 27:03.560
Rest well.

27:04.400 --> 27:07.080
I heard Miss Ji also fell seriously ill.

27:07.160 --> 27:09.040
I must pay her a visit.

27:10.080 --> 27:12.880
You promised me
you wouldn't harm her again.

27:17.000 --> 27:18.800
You must be mistaken.

27:19.360 --> 27:20.840
What I promised was this:

27:20.920 --> 27:23.160
As long as you comply with my wishes,

27:23.240 --> 27:24.840
I'll show mercy.

27:26.280 --> 27:28.440
But if you go back on your word

27:28.520 --> 27:30.400
and reconcile with her,

27:31.200 --> 27:33.520
I won't hold back.

27:35.120 --> 27:36.880
Rest well, my dear.

28:08.200 --> 28:09.560
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

28:09.640 --> 28:11.040
The delivery date has arrived,

28:11.120 --> 28:12.600
but the Ji family
still hasn't opened their door.

28:12.680 --> 28:13.960
- Yeah.
- Could they have run away?

28:14.040 --> 28:16.640
We've been standing here for days.

28:16.720 --> 28:18.360
Run? Where could they possibly go?

28:18.440 --> 28:20.320
Could they have hung themselves
out of guilt

28:20.400 --> 28:23.840
- because they couldn't deliver the goods?
- How can you say such things?

28:23.920 --> 28:25.640
If they're dead,
who's going to return my money?

28:25.720 --> 28:27.400
- Exactly!
- Open the door and hand over the silk!

28:27.480 --> 28:29.440
- Hand over the silk!
- Open the door and hand over the silk!

28:29.520 --> 28:32.120
Madam, the fire has already been lit.

28:32.840 --> 28:35.600
The lead shopkeeper is one of our people.

28:35.680 --> 28:37.880
- Hand over the silk!
- Open the door!

28:37.960 --> 28:40.440
- Open the door!
- Hand over the silk!

28:41.520 --> 28:42.600
What should we do now?

28:42.680 --> 28:44.680
Not fulfilling the orders
violates the contract.

28:44.760 --> 28:46.880
Fulfilling the orders violates the law.

28:47.440 --> 28:49.560
Should we open the door or not?

28:50.200 --> 28:52.080
Let's wait a bit longer.

28:54.080 --> 28:57.200
No more waiting.
You and Gui, head to the backyard first.

29:01.720 --> 29:03.720
Okay. Come on, Gui.

29:12.800 --> 29:13.920
Hand over the silk!

29:14.520 --> 29:16.320
- Open the door and hand over the silk!
- Hand over the silk!

29:16.840 --> 29:18.200
- Hand over the silk!
- Hand over the silk!

29:18.800 --> 29:20.760
- Hand over the silk!
- Hand over the silk!

29:22.680 --> 29:23.800
I'll hand over the silk.

29:28.560 --> 29:30.400
Esteemed sirs, apologies for the wait.

29:30.480 --> 29:32.320
You've been waiting
at my doorstep for so long.

29:32.400 --> 29:34.240
How about coming in
for a cup of hot tea first?

29:36.640 --> 29:37.720
I'll accept, then.

29:37.800 --> 29:39.840
- Let's go in!
- Fine, we'll go in.

29:39.920 --> 29:40.760
Still not handing over the silk?

29:58.080 --> 29:58.920
- Where's the silk?
- Where's the silk?

29:59.000 --> 30:00.360
- Bring out the silk!
- You can't hand it over, can you?

30:00.440 --> 30:01.760
- Where's the silk?
- Where's the silk?

30:01.840 --> 30:03.680
- Bring out the silk!
- Here's the silk!

30:23.000 --> 30:25.000
Yaoting, bring out our family's silk too.

30:25.080 --> 30:26.000
Got it.

30:38.120 --> 30:41.240
Every piece here is labeled
with the name of the respective shop.

30:41.320 --> 30:43.440
Everyone, please inspect the goods.

30:43.520 --> 30:45.160
How could you possibly have dyed this?

30:45.240 --> 30:46.440
- You don't even have safflower…
- What don't I have?

30:47.960 --> 30:49.800
Anyway, this Flushed Rose must be fake!

30:49.880 --> 30:51.800
It's definitely fake!

30:51.880 --> 30:54.400
Esteemed sirs,
you've been in business for decades.

30:54.480 --> 30:55.840
Can't you tell

30:55.920 --> 30:57.480
if this is real or fake?

30:57.560 --> 31:00.440
- How can you prove it's real?
- Then how can you prove it's fake?

31:00.520 --> 31:02.320
You need to prove first that it's real.

31:02.400 --> 31:04.040
You prove it's fake first!

31:04.120 --> 31:05.520
- Go ahead, prove it!
- How can it be real?

31:05.600 --> 31:06.840
It's fake!

31:06.920 --> 31:08.920
- Whether it's real or fake…
- It's fake!

31:09.000 --> 31:10.880
isn't that for me to decide?

31:21.240 --> 31:22.200
Inspector,

31:22.720 --> 31:24.480
- examine the goods.
- Understood.

31:39.760 --> 31:41.080
Report to Mr. Yang.

31:41.880 --> 31:45.480
I've completed the inspection.
This is indeed Flushed Rose.

31:45.560 --> 31:46.600
There's no doubt about it.

31:47.560 --> 31:48.680
Make sure you've checked thoroughly.

31:48.760 --> 31:51.520
This concerns the interests
of all brocade merchants

31:51.600 --> 31:53.080
and my reputation as well.

31:53.720 --> 31:56.080
No room for error.
Be sure before you speak.

31:56.760 --> 31:57.880
Absolutely sure.

31:58.400 --> 32:02.000
Not only is this silk colorfast,
but its luster is stunning.

32:02.080 --> 32:03.920
It's the finest of the fine.

32:04.000 --> 32:05.320
Although I've seen countless silks,

32:05.400 --> 32:08.000
this is the first time
I've encountered silk this exquisite.

32:08.080 --> 32:11.840
The lovely girls are drunk with wine
Their faces are flushed

32:12.360 --> 32:13.600
It's truly perfect.

32:13.680 --> 32:14.840
All right, enough.

32:15.360 --> 32:17.360
I asked you to inspect the silk,
not recite poetry.

32:19.880 --> 32:21.880
Everyone, if there are no objections,

32:21.960 --> 32:24.320
then as the brocade officer,
I bear witness here,

32:24.960 --> 32:27.080
money in one hand and goods in the other.

32:28.120 --> 32:30.240
- Wait.
- What now?

32:31.160 --> 32:32.160
Mr. Yang,

32:32.680 --> 32:35.880
you dare to publicly sell silk
that hasn't been officially registered?

32:35.960 --> 32:38.960
Miss Ji,
do you have no respect for the law?

32:39.840 --> 32:40.800
All of you who take her silk,

32:40.880 --> 32:42.600
aren't you afraid of getting involved
in a lawsuit?

32:43.240 --> 32:47.040
Mr. Yang,
shouldn't you enforce the law impartially?

32:47.560 --> 32:49.360
- Yeah!
- Exactly.

32:49.440 --> 32:50.560
- That's right, Mr. Yang!
- That's right, Mr. Yang!

32:55.320 --> 32:57.120
Zhuge Hong.

32:58.280 --> 33:00.680
I've been a bit forgetful lately.

33:00.760 --> 33:02.480
Do you recall whether this Flushed Rose

33:03.000 --> 33:04.600
was officially registered or not?

33:07.120 --> 33:09.520
Well… um…

33:10.040 --> 33:11.280
I'm not entirely sure.

33:11.840 --> 33:13.720
- We need to investigate.
- Exactly.

33:13.800 --> 33:17.080
Investigate thoroughly, carefully,

33:17.160 --> 33:18.520
and methodically.

33:19.640 --> 33:20.480
Understood.

33:27.760 --> 33:29.440
Can that guy really make it back in time?

33:30.240 --> 33:33.000
Almost, I'd say.
Please delay a bit longer.

33:34.480 --> 33:38.240
Truly, you have foresight, madam.
Yang Jinglan has indeed arrived.

33:39.080 --> 33:41.480
He seems to be intentionally stalling
for time.

33:44.720 --> 33:47.040
Since he dares
to wield imperial authority against me,

33:47.560 --> 33:49.160
then I'll show him,

33:49.680 --> 33:53.640
in Yizhou, who really calls the shots.

33:53.720 --> 33:56.920
Mr. Yang,
it's obvious you're stalling for time.

33:57.000 --> 33:58.040
Why are you in such a hurry?

33:58.120 --> 34:02.600
I've only recently taken office,
so I must act cautiously.

34:04.520 --> 34:07.080
Just hold on. We're investigating.

34:07.160 --> 34:09.280
- Exactly.
- They're investigating.

34:09.360 --> 34:10.960
- Why the rush?
- Mr. Yang,

34:11.040 --> 34:15.679
technically speaking, this Flushed Rose
was registered by you personally.

34:15.760 --> 34:17.840
How could you not remember?

34:17.920 --> 34:20.760
Zhuge,
what should we have for lunch today?

34:21.320 --> 34:22.960
What lunch? There's still a pile of things
to investigate.

34:23.040 --> 34:24.480
As a brocade officer,

34:25.239 --> 34:28.040
you openly abuse your power
in broad daylight,

34:28.120 --> 34:29.159
sheltering criminals!

34:36.719 --> 34:37.800
Greetings, Chief Sang!

34:41.719 --> 34:43.600
Chief Sang, what brings you here?

34:44.199 --> 34:46.679
They're all gossiping about me,
claiming Flushed Rose wasn't registered.

34:46.760 --> 34:48.280
Please, make a judgment call!

34:49.040 --> 34:50.280
Has Sang Shisi returned yet?

34:51.360 --> 34:54.199
Yes. Chief Sang,
you've come at the perfect time.

34:54.280 --> 34:55.760
I'm currently handling this case,

34:56.280 --> 34:57.560
but some unruly citizen
is stirring up trouble.

34:58.200 --> 35:00.400
Please help maintain order.

35:02.480 --> 35:05.720
Sang Shisi went to Chang'an
to visit his elder sister.

35:07.080 --> 35:08.520
Why are you asking about him?

35:10.520 --> 35:12.720
You didn't drag him

35:13.280 --> 35:15.000
into this mess too, did you?

35:28.000 --> 35:29.680
Her master summoned you here?

35:31.560 --> 35:34.480
Huanhua Dyehouse
is guilty of illicit dyeing

35:34.560 --> 35:36.160
and illegal trading.

35:36.240 --> 35:38.200
All personnel are to be detained,

35:38.280 --> 35:41.800
and all illegal goods are to be seized

35:41.880 --> 35:43.320
and destroyed!

35:43.400 --> 35:44.560
- No.
- Chief Sang!

35:44.640 --> 35:46.400
Chief Sang, please reconsider!

35:47.040 --> 35:49.640
- Nice! Burn it!
- Chief Sang,

35:51.680 --> 35:54.240
this case should be handled by me.
Why have you taken over?

35:55.640 --> 35:56.720
Mr. Yang,

35:57.520 --> 35:59.560
this case is serious
and of great significance.

35:59.640 --> 36:03.680
The higher-ups
have already assigned it to me.

36:04.200 --> 36:06.200
Do you have any objections?

36:08.000 --> 36:10.960
- Who are these "higher-ups"?
- The higher-ups are the higher-ups.

36:11.880 --> 36:12.800
You're already a member
of the imperial family.

36:12.880 --> 36:13.960
Why fear the higher-ups?

36:16.320 --> 36:18.080
I'm just a figurehead.

36:18.600 --> 36:21.280
They are the ones with real power.

36:22.720 --> 36:25.520
- Guards, take them away!
- Yes, sir!

36:25.600 --> 36:27.720
This all started because of me.
Take me instead!

36:27.800 --> 36:29.160
"A child's fault reflects the father's
failure." I take on a father's role.

36:29.240 --> 36:31.040
Direct it at me!

36:31.120 --> 36:33.760
- She didn't do it. Arrest me instead!
- Take me!

36:33.840 --> 36:35.240
Why all the shouting?

36:35.960 --> 36:38.440
None of you are getting away.
Take them all!

36:40.560 --> 36:42.440
Chief Sang, hold on!

36:54.200 --> 36:58.120
Yingying, rest for a moment.
I will speak on your behalf.

37:00.240 --> 37:03.400
Obstructing official duties
is a serious crime.

37:04.000 --> 37:06.600
Even if they don't understand,
are you confused too?

37:09.120 --> 37:13.000
Chief Sang, I have a few words to say.

37:15.520 --> 37:16.520
All of you,

37:17.680 --> 37:20.800
I know that you didn't come here today
to harm the Ji family,

37:21.800 --> 37:23.520
but to claim your silk.

37:23.600 --> 37:25.920
The Flushed Rose silk
is right here before you.

37:26.800 --> 37:29.600
Now, with your investments at risk,

37:30.120 --> 37:32.400
will you stand by and do nothing?

37:36.720 --> 37:37.560
As for the registration process,

37:37.640 --> 37:40.200
someone clearly targeted
the Ji family deliberately.

37:41.320 --> 37:43.360
The Ji family has brought glory
to the brocade industry.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.760
What crime have we committed?

37:46.000 --> 37:49.080
If the Ji family is taken away today
and no one stands up for us,

37:49.600 --> 37:52.480
when you face challenges in the future,

37:52.560 --> 37:54.560
will there still be anyone
willing to help you?

37:58.000 --> 37:59.360
Enough!

38:00.560 --> 38:02.760
Do not incite others intentionally.

38:06.840 --> 38:08.280
Chief Sang,

38:08.920 --> 38:10.040
public sentiment is hard to ignore.

38:10.920 --> 38:13.640
If you insist on burning the silk today,

38:13.720 --> 38:15.520
you may lose the trust of the people.

38:17.480 --> 38:18.920
As their leader,

38:19.440 --> 38:20.520
are you not afraid
that the citizens of Yizhou

38:20.600 --> 38:21.960
will criticize you behind your back?

38:22.040 --> 38:23.840
That's right, Chief Sang.

38:23.920 --> 38:25.560
My mother is right!

38:25.640 --> 38:26.520
Aunt Ji is right, isn't she?

38:26.600 --> 38:28.040
- Yes!
- Isn't she right?

38:28.120 --> 38:29.000
That's correct!

38:38.440 --> 38:39.280
Chief Sang,

38:39.360 --> 38:41.120
please judge wisely!

38:45.200 --> 38:46.840
Since public sentiment is as such,

38:47.360 --> 38:48.600
I…

38:49.120 --> 38:51.000
will not go against you.

38:51.080 --> 38:54.040
As for the silk,
I will not burn it for now.

38:54.880 --> 38:55.960
However, the people…

38:56.480 --> 38:58.120
I must take them with me today!

38:58.680 --> 39:00.720
Spare them!

39:02.840 --> 39:04.040
Spare them!

39:12.000 --> 39:13.280
These are the registration documents.

39:13.360 --> 39:16.240
You have a copy and I have one too.
What should we do next?

39:17.920 --> 39:19.760
Didn't you already predict it?

39:20.880 --> 39:22.440
I can't predict this.

39:25.680 --> 39:27.520
The registration process is lengthy,

39:27.600 --> 39:30.360
and those with ill intentions
will surely obstruct it.

39:30.440 --> 39:34.560
Rather than guarding against every step,
we'll leave one copy in the open,

39:34.640 --> 39:36.000
and let them play their tricks.

39:37.080 --> 39:40.040
As for the other copy,
we'll deliver it secretly.

39:40.120 --> 39:42.920
Find someone to take it to Chang'an,

39:43.000 --> 39:45.720
and this person must complete
the task discreetly in Chang'an.

39:46.880 --> 39:49.720
- Do you have someone in mind?
- Indeed, I do.

39:53.640 --> 39:56.240
Here is an imperial edict! Kneel!

40:03.400 --> 40:06.320
"Falling petals drift, their numbers grow,

40:06.840 --> 40:08.960
The beauty, flushed, in a drunken glow."

40:09.600 --> 40:12.200
The Empress recently
received a Flushed Rose silk fan.

40:12.280 --> 40:15.440
She performed a dance
for His Majesty with it,

40:15.520 --> 40:16.960
greatly pleasing him!

40:17.560 --> 40:22.360
His Majesty has ordered to purchase
Shu brocade made of Flushed Rose silk

40:22.440 --> 40:24.840
to craft gowns for the Empress!

40:28.520 --> 40:30.720
That's… That's all. Rise.

40:39.120 --> 40:40.200
Is this edict from His Majesty?

40:41.560 --> 40:43.920
Yes, exactly. Who are you?

40:44.000 --> 40:45.240
What proof do you have?

40:46.120 --> 40:49.240
If you have none,
this could be a capital offense.

40:50.000 --> 40:52.040
You brat! You dare demand proof
for an imperial edict?

40:52.120 --> 40:55.600
You brat…
Drinking makes you spout nonsense!

40:55.680 --> 40:58.320
- I'm not spouting nonsense…
- Everyone, my son is drunk.

40:58.400 --> 40:59.640
- No!
- He's drunk!

40:59.720 --> 41:01.080
- I'm not drunk! I'm not drunk!
- Shut up!

41:01.160 --> 41:02.480
Since it's a joke,

41:03.080 --> 41:06.000
Chief Sang, shouldn't you take them away?

41:06.080 --> 41:09.080
- Well, then… take them!
- No!

41:09.160 --> 41:11.840
Wait a moment!
I haven't finished… There's more!

41:14.600 --> 41:15.440
‪FLUSHED ROSE

41:15.520 --> 41:18.680
Here's the registration document.
It's stamped by Chang'an authorities.

41:23.680 --> 41:24.520
APPLYING FOR APPROVAL TO REGISTER
AND SELL FLUSHED ROSE SILK

41:24.600 --> 41:26.800
Such a treasure,
why are you only bringing it out now?

41:26.880 --> 41:28.200
Is an imperial edict useless?

41:29.760 --> 41:31.200
Chief Sang.

41:31.280 --> 41:32.840
Is the registration process complete?

41:33.600 --> 41:34.960
- It's complete.
- It's complete!

41:35.040 --> 41:38.080
Since the registration is complete,

41:38.160 --> 41:39.680
there's nothing more for me.

41:39.760 --> 41:42.960
I'll leave the aftermath to Mr. Yang.

41:43.880 --> 41:45.000
Farewell.

41:47.120 --> 41:48.800
- Let's go!
- Move!

41:59.080 --> 42:00.600
Since it was all a misunderstanding,

42:01.120 --> 42:03.520
let's proceed
with the transaction as planned.

42:05.120 --> 42:07.840
Esteemed sirs, please inspect the silk
and settle the remaining payment.

42:11.240 --> 42:13.280
- This is mine.
- This is mine.

42:13.360 --> 42:14.800
That one is mine.

42:15.440 --> 42:16.840
This is mine.

42:16.920 --> 42:18.800
What a relief!
We've finally cleared our name!

42:18.880 --> 42:20.520
How about hosting a banquet
at my house to celebrate?

42:20.600 --> 42:22.680
- Sounds great!
- Just waiting for you to say it.

42:22.760 --> 42:23.880
I'll handle the arrangements!

42:24.400 --> 42:25.360
Let's go.

42:26.440 --> 42:27.560
I'm exhausted.

42:32.120 --> 42:36.240
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

42:37.120 --> 42:39.360
- How dare you!
- Yu Yuan,

42:39.440 --> 42:40.760
let her on.
